    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the batch_translate.py file, I need to integrate with a concrete external translation provider. I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is a neural machine translation service that delivers fast, high-quality, and affordable language translation. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Translate client to translate a list of strings. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789848748731,
